Vulnérabilité critique CVE-2026-61559 affectant @zereight/mcp-gitlab (npm) (score CVSS 9.6).

@zereight/mcp-gitlab Vulnerable to Server-Side Request Forgery

When the environment variable ENABLE_DYNAMIC_API_URL=true is set, the server reads the X-GitLab-API-URL HTTP request header and uses it as the base URL for all outbound GitLab API calls made within that request. The server validates that the value is a well-formed URL ( new URL(dynamicApiUrl) ) but applies no allowlist or hostname restriction.

